{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生ドルでした！\n記念すべき40回目だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/28/3562096/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マジカル・パンチラインさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/28/3562096/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浅野杏奈さん・佐藤麗奈さん・沖口優奈さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"注目してたマジパンさん！\n会ってみたかったんです！！\n会えて嬉しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/28/3562096/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドル定番企画のおさわり占いとカナヲ\n二つともやらせてもらいましたが\nがっつりカナヲも釣られてたみたいで！\nみんなカナヲにも神対応できる対応力に\n感動してしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/28/3562096/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SUPER☆GiRLSさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/28/3562096/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"志村理佳さん・溝手るかさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お二人とも2回目の出演\nありがとうございます！\n本当にあっという間でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バーバー松村っていう新企画を\n試させて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/28/3562096/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失礼しました\nツインテールしてるお二人も可愛いのに\nツインテール恥ずかしがってる姿がさらに可愛かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/28/3562096/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/28/3562096/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界の北野さん・樋口一葉さん・吉永小百合さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃなくて\nきいちゃん・ひなちま・さゆにゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オープニングのミュージカル\n次 流れるのが怖いです...\nさゆにゃんがどうしてこの髪型なの？\nみたいになってる観てない方は\n観てください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てくださったみなさん\nコメントくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/28/3562096/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pigooやタイムシフトで観てくださる方は\nお楽しみに～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}